// {"files":[{"path":"\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\danie\\OneDrive\\github-repos\\ed-docs\\README.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":112,"oldLines":6,"newStart":112,"newLines":23,"lines":[" "," Jeglicher Sync / Collaboration bleibt optional – lokale Docs + Core Editor sollen immer offline funktionieren."," ","+#### Vim-Gaps to close (quick wins)","+- Ex addresses: `:3`, `:10,20d`, `:%p`, `w filename`, `:e!`","+- `u` undo, `yy / dd / p` yank-paste, `/search`, `.` repeat","+- Word motions (`w, b, e`), `gg / G`, `A / I / O`, `r` replace, `~` case-flip","+- Make selection feel alive in NORMAL mode (currently readOnly textarea)","+- Word count, reading time, markdown preview (`:preview`)","+- `:history` / snapshots instead of just a dirty flag","+","+#### Fun / niche – deliberately not generic","+1. **ed-the-grumpy-clerk:** editor talks back in real `ed` style. `?` on every error, sarcastic `:help`, passive-aggressive `:w` (\"finally. 42 lines saved.\").","+2. **`:w` ritual:** `:w` with typewriter ka-chunk, paper shake, \"WRITTEN\" stamp. `:q` without `:w` makes the page crumple-shake. Save as ceremony.","+3. **Vim-golf score:** keystroke efficiency per doc. `h,j,k,l` spam lowers it, `:` commands raise it. Local leaderboard – no prose editor does this.","+4. **`:s/old/new/g` as star:** ex search-replace with live preview + `gc` confirm mode. Most web editors hide this.","+5. **Distraction seance (`:gloom` / `:candle`):** dark paper + candle flicker via CSS, only current line lit, typewriter sounds.","+6. **`q:` tape:** last 20 `:` commands as a replayable tape, replay with Enter.","+7. **Achievements, ed-style:** \"First `:wq`\", \"100 lines without mouse\", \"1000 chars deleted with `x`\". Stored locally as fortune stamps.","+"," ### Lizenz"," "," GNU GPLv3 – siehe [LICENSE](LICENSE). Ursprünglich MIT 2026, am 11.10.2026 zurück auf original GPL restored."]}]}]}
